{"id":"vod_bf_40739","vodId":"40739","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"血界战线","name_cn":"血界战线","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-41/faeb0083efa2e27d4ff4e13cb2239fed.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为赫尔沙雷姆兹·罗特的虚构城市中，时空扭曲让异世界和人类世界发生了联结，生活在异世界中的古老种族“血界眷属”因此降临，给人类的安全造成了极大的威胁。为了维护世界的和平，一个名为“秘密结社莱布拉”的秘密组织在暗地里活跃地行动着。　　雷欧（阪口大助 配音）本是一个平凡的少年，机缘巧合之下，他误打误撞加入了莱布拉，成为了惩奸除恶的一份子，继而结识了外表粗犷内心温柔的克劳斯（小山力也 配音）、个性开朗油嘴滑舌的扎普（中井和哉 配音）和外表普通实则是狼人的钱皇（小林优 配音）等人。这些志同道合的好友让雷欧的生活拉开了别样的序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:59:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xuejiezhanxian/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:11.680Z"}